# Agent configuration and internal research — stowed, not published.
# These stay on disk so local tooling keeps working; they are tracked in the
# stow repository instead. Build-critical files formerly under docs/ and
# .codex/ now live in schemas/validation-rules/, scripts/reference/ and
# rules/agent-boundaries/ — see .stow-README.md.
/.claude/
/.codex/
/docs/
/AGENT.md
/AGENTS.md
